WEBVTT

01:38.130 --> 01:40.979
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.030 --> 01:44.000
[Episode 5]

02:22.400 --> 02:22.950
Sir.

02:23.160 --> 02:23.990
Your dishes are here.

02:43.030 --> 02:44.150
This should be

02:44.360 --> 02:45.840
the roasted camel hump, right?

02:46.400 --> 02:46.880
They say

02:46.910 --> 02:48.280
it's a delicacy from the Western Regions.

02:48.630 --> 02:49.280
Try it quickly.

03:02.080 --> 03:02.710
Is it good?

03:04.420 --> 03:05.000
It's good.

03:07.240 --> 03:07.910
Then have some more.

03:09.150 --> 03:09.680
Here.

03:10.150 --> 03:10.840
This one's big.

03:11.310 --> 03:11.800
Take it.

03:12.910 --> 03:13.560
Have another piece.

03:13.800 --> 03:14.680
You eat it yourself.

03:14.910 --> 03:15.630
No need to serve me.

03:16.430 --> 03:17.750
I'm not serving you.

03:19.030 --> 03:20.750
Back in Nanyang,

03:20.840 --> 03:21.910
you saved my life,

03:22.430 --> 03:23.590
saved Yanqiu's life,

03:24.240 --> 03:25.280
and saved my whole family.

03:25.710 --> 03:26.530
I didn't even get the chance

03:26.560 --> 03:27.520
to thank you properly.

03:28.280 --> 03:29.470
Now I'm asking for your help again.

03:29.490 --> 03:30.250
Of course, I feel

03:30.280 --> 03:31.310
a bit guilty about it.

03:33.150 --> 03:34.150
You don't need to feel guilty.

03:34.710 --> 03:36.000
Besides, I haven't decided to help you yet.

03:39.000 --> 03:40.000
You will soon, anyway.

03:46.030 --> 03:46.800
Xuanye?

03:48.820 --> 03:50.520
Can I call you that?

03:54.590 --> 03:56.560
I feel that calling you Physician Jiu

03:57.030 --> 03:58.910
or Mr. Jiu makes you sound a bit old.

04:00.080 --> 04:01.520
You can call me Banxia too.

04:09.150 --> 04:10.590
Guangping is indeed different.

04:11.910 --> 04:13.560
As expected of the ancient capital of three dynasties.

04:14.310 --> 04:15.400
The imperial family is wealthy.

04:16.360 --> 04:16.920
Look,

04:17.510 --> 04:18.750
the people here are different.

04:21.950 --> 04:23.610
Are you a local from Guangping?

04:24.830 --> 04:25.360
Yes.

04:26.430 --> 04:27.560
I thought so.

04:27.950 --> 04:28.870
People from big cities

04:30.040 --> 04:31.330
are all knowledgeable and experienced,

04:31.510 --> 04:32.240
with extraordinary demeanor.

04:32.720 --> 04:34.120
Can you not talk during meals?

04:51.120 --> 04:54.120
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

04:59.480 --> 05:02.480
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

05:08.870 --> 05:09.360
Bravo!

05:09.720 --> 05:10.430
Bravo!

05:10.750 --> 05:11.240
Bravo!

05:11.920 --> 05:12.360
Bravo!

05:13.660 --> 05:14.370
Something's not right.

05:21.080 --> 05:22.080
What's going on?

05:22.870 --> 05:24.070
Wasn't she dancing just fine a moment ago?

05:24.090 --> 05:24.800
That's right.

05:29.680 --> 05:30.680
Quick, take a look, take a look.

05:34.950 --> 05:35.550
Don't be afraid.

05:35.870 --> 05:36.560
Whatever I ask,

05:36.560 --> 05:37.510
just answer accordingly.

05:38.040 --> 05:38.920
What was your relationship

05:39.560 --> 05:40.120
with the deceased?

05:40.150 --> 05:41.240
We have no relationship.

05:41.430 --> 05:42.600
We just arrived here not long ago.

05:42.830 --> 05:43.480
Listen to me.

05:43.480 --> 05:44.600
As she was spinning, she suddenly collapsed.

05:46.830 --> 05:47.600
Someone's died.

05:51.870 --> 05:53.270
Before Tian Rui, the deceased, went on stage,

05:53.830 --> 05:54.920
who had seen her?

05:56.830 --> 05:57.310
Officer,

05:57.630 --> 05:58.600
I'm not sure.

05:59.190 --> 06:00.950
The backstage is off-limits to outsiders.

06:01.560 --> 06:02.120
It should be

06:02.170 --> 06:03.750
only people from their dance troupe, I guess.

06:07.430 --> 06:08.600
Are there any other exits here?

06:10.240 --> 06:10.630
Yes.

06:11.330 --> 06:12.040
This way, please.

06:12.070 --> 06:12.570
Lead the way.

06:22.070 --> 06:22.630
Officer.

06:23.210 --> 06:23.970
This was where Tian Rui

06:24.000 --> 06:24.720
did her makeup.

06:26.720 --> 06:27.240
I see.

06:27.630 --> 06:28.240
You can go out first.

06:28.630 --> 06:29.120
Yes.

06:36.920 --> 06:37.470
Chief Constable Wen,

06:38.310 --> 06:38.870
Chief Chu said

06:39.120 --> 06:40.040
to bring the deceased's belongings

06:40.120 --> 06:41.070
to the government office for examination.

06:41.409 --> 06:41.920
Alright.

06:42.520 --> 06:43.150
Oh, right.

06:43.630 --> 06:44.770
bring everyone outside

06:44.800 --> 06:45.880
back for questioning later.

06:46.070 --> 06:46.510
Understood.

06:59.830 --> 07:00.240
My lord.

07:00.830 --> 07:01.430
What's the situation?

07:02.480 --> 07:03.000
My lord,

07:03.480 --> 07:05.070
the deceased was a dancer from Yunmen Dance Troupe.

07:05.230 --> 07:06.430
She suddenly died on stage during the performance.

07:08.830 --> 07:09.600
Tian Rui?

07:10.720 --> 07:11.390
Do you know her?

07:14.040 --> 07:14.870
More than a decade ago,

07:15.680 --> 07:16.850
I had a brief encounter

07:16.950 --> 07:17.920
with her.

07:19.600 --> 07:20.750
Her performance of the Xi River Formation

07:21.040 --> 07:22.350
was as graceful as a dragon.

07:22.510 --> 07:24.360
The audience was massive and the cheers were thunderous.

07:24.920 --> 07:26.070
Even now, thinking back,

07:26.800 --> 07:27.920
it's still vivid in my mind.

07:29.360 --> 07:30.160
I never thought...

07:31.800 --> 07:32.950
More than a decade ago?

07:33.940 --> 07:35.060
She must have been quite young, right?

07:35.750 --> 07:36.120
Yes.

07:37.240 --> 07:38.040
She was in her twenties,

07:38.510 --> 07:40.480
the prime of a woman's life.

07:57.040 --> 07:57.510
Well...

07:58.240 --> 07:58.890
Is this the Tian Rui

07:58.920 --> 07:59.680
that you know?

08:00.600 --> 08:01.310
Yes,

08:01.680 --> 08:02.610
indeed,

08:03.120 --> 08:03.830
but

08:04.830 --> 08:06.680
more than a decade has passed.

08:07.240 --> 08:08.360
Why hasn't her appearance

08:08.720 --> 08:09.630
changed at all?

08:10.070 --> 08:10.480
My lord,

08:11.240 --> 08:12.600
I've heard that the women in dance troupes

08:12.630 --> 08:13.750
all have their own secret methods for maintaining their youth.

08:14.160 --> 08:15.390
Combined with makeup and attire,

08:15.750 --> 08:16.720
looking young

08:17.070 --> 08:17.900
isn't really surprising.

08:20.870 --> 08:21.310
Lord Geng,

08:22.120 --> 08:23.270
the cause of death is unknown.

08:23.950 --> 08:25.270
I humbly request your permission

08:25.390 --> 08:25.830
for an autopsy.

08:26.690 --> 08:27.730
A body should not be casually examined.

08:28.240 --> 08:29.920
We need the family's consent first.

08:30.830 --> 08:32.350
If the autopsy yielded no results,

08:32.559 --> 08:33.919
it would be difficult to explain to the family.

08:35.440 --> 08:35.840
My lord,

08:36.840 --> 08:38.030
I suspect this case

08:38.510 --> 08:39.150
is a poisoning.

08:41.650 --> 08:42.360
I've led a team to inspect

08:42.390 --> 08:43.240
the kitchen of Yanlai Restaurant.

08:43.630 --> 08:44.390
We found nothing unusual.

08:45.480 --> 08:46.550
Could it be that she

08:46.870 --> 08:47.850
died suddenly from an illness?

08:52.510 --> 08:53.000
Wen Jian,

08:54.480 --> 08:55.120
what do you think?

08:55.840 --> 08:56.440
My lord, I...

08:57.870 --> 08:58.720
I think I'd better

08:58.750 --> 08:59.540
not say anything.

09:00.510 --> 09:02.240
Feel free to express your opinions. Don't hesitate.

09:03.790 --> 09:04.150
My lord,

09:04.960 --> 09:05.840
I believe

09:06.730 --> 09:07.810
this is the work of demons.

09:08.480 --> 09:09.480
Whenever we encounter a difficult case,

09:09.510 --> 09:10.630
you always say it's the work of demons.

09:11.960 --> 09:13.120
You said that female thief who slit throats last time

09:13.140 --> 09:14.150
was also a demon.

09:14.630 --> 09:15.090
But in the end?

09:15.600 --> 09:17.330
In the end, I invited Xuanye to come out of seclusion

09:17.360 --> 09:18.870
to eliminate that demon.

09:19.360 --> 09:20.080
The lord is present here.

09:20.360 --> 09:21.480
How dare you still spout such nonsense?

09:21.630 --> 09:23.360
It was the lord who said we should express our own views.

09:28.360 --> 09:28.750
My lord,

09:29.010 --> 09:29.700
this corpse...

09:33.240 --> 09:33.950
Next.

09:41.360 --> 09:41.910
What's your name?

09:44.540 --> 09:45.450
Are you hungry?

09:45.480 --> 09:46.670
I'll go buy you something to eat.

09:48.240 --> 09:48.670
No need.

09:51.730 --> 09:52.330
It's my fault.

09:52.360 --> 09:53.830
I didn't choose a good place to eat.

09:54.100 --> 09:56.000
Next time, I'll invite you to have dinner at my place

09:56.030 --> 09:56.910
as compensation.

09:58.270 --> 09:59.360
We're neighbors.

09:59.390 --> 10:00.390
We live very close to each other.

10:00.670 --> 10:01.910
You'll be there just by stepping out the door.

10:02.390 --> 10:03.410
My cooking skills are quite good.

10:06.030 --> 10:07.000
You really like cooking?

10:07.750 --> 10:08.570
I'm just cooking

10:08.600 --> 10:10.000
for my savior.

10:14.480 --> 10:15.330
Last time I saw you

10:15.360 --> 10:16.270
in Nanyang,

10:16.670 --> 10:17.750
you weren't like this at all.

10:18.440 --> 10:19.120
Of course.

10:20.080 --> 10:20.760
At that time,

10:20.790 --> 10:22.390
you were willing to help voluntarily.

10:22.840 --> 10:24.120
Now that you're unwilling,

10:24.450 --> 10:25.640
my attitude naturally needs to have

10:25.670 --> 10:26.870
a slight change.

10:33.960 --> 10:34.550
Next.

10:45.200 --> 10:45.910
What's your name?

10:46.320 --> 10:46.720
Chief Constable Wen.

10:46.740 --> 10:47.600
Are you finished?

10:47.670 --> 10:48.150
Not yet.

10:48.170 --> 10:49.550
I still need to go to Ganshan Clinic again.

10:50.080 --> 10:50.550
Hey, Xuanye.

10:52.550 --> 10:53.000
Xuanye?

10:53.480 --> 10:55.030
You... Why are you here?

10:57.150 --> 10:58.630
I went out for dinner last night

10:58.840 --> 10:59.510
and had bad luck,

10:59.530 --> 11:00.150
so...

11:01.960 --> 11:03.240
You were also at Yanlai Restaurant last night?

11:04.080 --> 11:04.600
Yes.

11:05.320 --> 11:05.790
That's perfect.

11:05.870 --> 11:06.480
I'm investigating

11:06.510 --> 11:07.240
the case at Yanlai Restaurant.

11:07.500 --> 11:08.200
Quick, follow me.

11:08.200 --> 11:08.750
Let's meet with the lord.

11:13.440 --> 11:13.750
Well...

11:15.960 --> 11:16.910
She's with me.

11:18.550 --> 11:19.000
Alright then.

11:20.120 --> 11:20.630
Let's go together.

11:33.930 --> 11:34.720
I've brought him here.

11:34.750 --> 11:35.320
Where are you going?

11:36.510 --> 11:37.120
Relying on him?

11:38.690 --> 11:39.410
I'd rather hope

11:39.440 --> 11:40.200
the murderer would turn himself in.

11:42.720 --> 11:43.870
I don't have time for your nonsense.

11:47.960 --> 11:48.440
Don't mind him.

11:55.080 --> 11:56.320
The prefectural governor is inside.

11:56.720 --> 11:57.550
Do you still want to go in?

12:00.150 --> 12:01.440
Then I'll wait for you outside.

12:15.190 --> 12:15.870
Wen Jian.

12:16.360 --> 12:16.960
Tell Physician Jiu

12:16.960 --> 12:18.120
about everything.

12:18.790 --> 12:19.440
Yes, my lord.

12:21.510 --> 12:22.000
This deceased person

12:22.080 --> 12:23.870
was a dancer from Yunmen Dance Troupe.

12:24.200 --> 12:25.910
A few days ago, she suddenly became young again.

12:27.630 --> 12:28.320
This big box

12:28.390 --> 12:29.440
should be placed in the evidence room.

12:31.600 --> 12:32.440
I heard that

12:32.480 --> 12:33.200
Physician Jiu from Ganshan Clinic has arrived.

12:33.750 --> 12:34.480
What's he here for?

12:36.030 --> 12:36.630
I don't know.

12:38.720 --> 12:39.750
Be careful.

12:39.870 --> 12:40.750
The box is broken.

12:43.030 --> 12:43.960
Do you need help?

12:45.030 --> 12:45.600
Thank you.

12:47.800 --> 12:49.200
This case is really bizarre.

12:49.550 --> 12:51.600
I heard that the deceased actually transformed after death.

12:52.550 --> 12:53.240
What did she turn into?

12:53.750 --> 12:54.750
When she was brought back,

12:54.750 --> 12:55.670
she was still a young beauty.

12:56.080 --> 12:56.790
After a while,

12:56.870 --> 12:58.720
she turned into a mummified old woman.

12:58.840 --> 12:59.630
Seriously?

13:00.680 --> 13:01.760
See for yourself in a moment

13:01.790 --> 13:02.510
and you'll know.

13:12.990 --> 13:13.510
Thanks.

13:20.230 --> 13:21.390
That's pretty much how it happened.

13:23.240 --> 13:24.630
This case is indeed bizarre,

13:25.480 --> 13:26.840
but we can't be certain yet

13:26.860 --> 13:27.740
that it's the work of a demon.

13:29.910 --> 13:30.320
My lord,

13:30.960 --> 13:32.480
I need to go to the deceased's residence

13:32.670 --> 13:33.240
to investigate further.

13:34.910 --> 13:35.750
After the incident,

13:35.840 --> 13:36.510
I've already sent people

13:36.550 --> 13:37.960
to seal off the entire dance hall.

13:40.600 --> 13:42.080
You accompany Physician Jiu for another visit.

13:42.360 --> 13:43.150
Examine carefully.

13:43.850 --> 13:46.040
Even if it's truly the work of a demon,

13:46.410 --> 13:47.250
don't spread the word.

13:48.240 --> 13:48.670
Yes.

13:48.980 --> 13:49.650
Thank you, my lord.

13:55.630 --> 13:56.150
What are you looking for?

13:57.750 --> 13:58.200
Nothing.

13:58.630 --> 13:59.000
Let's go.

14:09.750 --> 14:10.960
Excuse me, officer.

14:11.960 --> 14:12.440
What is it?

14:12.630 --> 14:14.480
Can I take another look at that dressing mirror

14:14.500 --> 14:15.790
I picked up earlier?

14:18.080 --> 14:18.630
Why?

14:21.080 --> 14:22.870
Because I think it looks nice.

14:24.790 --> 14:25.240
Miss,

14:25.860 --> 14:27.580
these are all pieces of evidence.

14:28.000 --> 14:30.120
Unauthorized personnel are not allowed to examine them.

14:31.320 --> 14:32.480
You'd better go home quickly.

14:56.840 --> 14:57.630
Officer,

14:58.320 --> 14:59.290
how's it going inside?

14:59.320 --> 15:00.690
When will Physician Jiu come out?

15:00.720 --> 15:01.200
Physician Jiu

15:01.390 --> 15:01.960
left a long time ago.

15:02.790 --> 15:03.560
Where did he go?

15:03.790 --> 15:04.790
Chief Constable Wen took him away.

15:04.920 --> 15:05.450
They were in a hurry.

15:05.480 --> 15:06.320
I think they went to investigate the case.

15:08.870 --> 15:09.480
Thank you.

15:13.480 --> 15:14.500
I can't explain it clearly anyway.

15:14.630 --> 15:15.670
Let's go in and take a look first.

15:18.000 --> 15:18.520
It's here.

15:21.750 --> 15:22.240
Chief Constable Wen.

15:22.450 --> 15:24.260
This is the deceased Tian Rui's room.

15:51.240 --> 15:52.840
How long had it been since she last returned here?

15:54.090 --> 15:54.670
What's wrong?

15:56.100 --> 15:57.360
The tea strainer has grown small bugs.

15:57.960 --> 15:58.570
It seems she hadn't

15:58.600 --> 15:59.870
been back to clean for a long time.

16:02.240 --> 16:03.270
Their troupe leader said

16:03.270 --> 16:04.960
ever since Tian Rui had regained her youth,

16:04.960 --> 16:06.200
she had been pursued

16:06.220 --> 16:06.980
by the rich young men in the city.

16:07.630 --> 16:09.000
She sang and danced tirelessly day and night,

16:09.360 --> 16:10.200
and barely returned here.

16:18.030 --> 16:19.270
W-What is this?

16:20.720 --> 16:21.480
It's pear skin.

16:21.880 --> 16:22.360
Pear skin?

16:23.550 --> 16:24.590
Have you heard

16:24.730 --> 16:26.390
about the legend of the jade pear?

16:29.840 --> 16:31.320
It's said that if one sits alone

16:31.670 --> 16:33.390
in a closed room at midnight,

16:33.960 --> 16:34.910
face a mirror,

16:35.320 --> 16:36.120
light two candles,

16:36.600 --> 16:37.510
and peel a pear

16:37.790 --> 16:39.670
while reciting the jade pear nursery rhyme,

16:39.870 --> 16:40.790
then if the pear skin

16:41.030 --> 16:42.120
remains intact after reciting,

16:42.440 --> 16:43.550
one can summon

16:43.570 --> 16:44.480
the pear-delivering demon.

16:54.240 --> 16:56.320
This jade pear is also called the rejuvenating pear.

16:57.080 --> 16:57.990
Once consumed,

16:58.210 --> 16:59.440
it can restore youth overnight.

17:01.000 --> 17:01.910
Restore youth overnight?

17:02.550 --> 17:03.150
That does match up.

17:03.960 --> 17:05.380
Tian Rui had always been passionate about

17:05.400 --> 17:06.550
methods for maintaining health and beauty,

17:06.880 --> 17:08.000
but they'd never been very effective.

17:09.030 --> 17:10.400
You think she ate the jade pear?

17:12.589 --> 17:13.160
Perhaps.

17:15.599 --> 17:16.550
Where is her body?

17:17.480 --> 17:18.240
Still at the government office.

17:18.640 --> 17:20.130
Youhuang knows the lord is looking for you to solve the case.

17:20.160 --> 17:21.589
He absolutely refuses to give me the key to the mortuary.

17:21.750 --> 17:22.680
I'll go see the lord again tomorrow morning.

17:23.510 --> 17:24.109
We can't wait.

17:24.990 --> 17:25.800
Tell Chi Xue to go.

17:41.750 --> 17:43.400
This mirror has a time limit.

17:44.500 --> 17:46.000
If I don't go now, it'll be too late.

17:56.750 --> 17:58.440
But if I tell him directly,

17:58.440 --> 17:59.790
he might not believe me.

18:02.310 --> 18:03.310
Never mind all that.

18:05.830 --> 18:06.590
Friend, I'm leaving.

18:07.550 --> 18:08.480
Let's get a drink another day.

19:10.590 --> 19:11.590
They're asleep?

19:49.830 --> 19:50.880
Are you following me?

20:11.590 --> 20:12.160
I see.

20:13.310 --> 20:14.790
She must have taken an immortality elixir.

20:16.960 --> 20:17.350
Yes.

20:17.830 --> 20:18.310
Chief,

20:18.510 --> 20:19.200
you guessed right.

20:20.150 --> 20:20.750
Um,

20:21.310 --> 20:22.510
can I go home now?

20:22.690 --> 20:23.380
Wait a moment.

20:24.400 --> 20:25.480
According to this book,

20:26.510 --> 20:27.560
in ancient times, there was someone called

20:27.590 --> 20:28.440
Chi Songzi

20:29.160 --> 20:29.790
who consumed a type of

20:29.810 --> 20:31.690
immortality elixir called Ice Jade Powder.

20:32.310 --> 20:33.750
From then on, he became immortal.

20:34.000 --> 20:35.070
He could even control the wind and rain.

20:38.790 --> 20:39.880
There was also someone named Peng Zu

20:40.030 --> 20:41.000
who took an immortality elixir

20:41.720 --> 20:42.880
and lived for over 800 years.

20:45.070 --> 20:46.480
In more recent times,

20:47.240 --> 20:48.280
there was a Taoist priest in Hongzhou

20:48.310 --> 20:49.350
with the surname Hu

20:49.720 --> 20:51.960
who claimed to have taken an immortality pill

20:52.240 --> 20:53.550
and lived for over 400 years.

20:54.060 --> 20:55.300
It's said he's still alive today.

20:56.740 --> 20:57.850
However, the old man

20:57.880 --> 20:59.070
likes to travel all over the world,

20:59.480 --> 21:01.000
making it difficult for ordinary people to find him.

21:02.510 --> 21:02.960
Chief,

21:03.750 --> 21:04.310
that's it?

21:04.920 --> 21:05.480
You believe this?

21:05.680 --> 21:06.910
Of course I don't believe it.

21:07.750 --> 21:09.030
If such a miraculous medicine really existed,

21:09.790 --> 21:11.400
how could there still be dynastic changes

21:11.590 --> 21:12.920
and transfers of power?

21:15.160 --> 21:15.720
I don't believe it,

21:16.160 --> 21:17.400
but that doesn't mean others don't.

21:17.960 --> 21:18.750
This book mentions

21:19.640 --> 21:20.920
that some people, in pursuit of immortality,

21:21.150 --> 21:22.090
become obsessed with elixirs

21:22.430 --> 21:24.690
and ultimately die from poisoning

21:25.110 --> 21:25.930
while bleeding profusely.

21:30.110 --> 21:31.440
Tian Rui's corpse

21:31.840 --> 21:32.940
aged instantly,

21:33.310 --> 21:34.160
which is indeed strange.

21:36.960 --> 21:38.590
I know that nowadays there are some alchemists

21:39.030 --> 21:40.180
who do possess certain skills.

21:40.500 --> 21:41.480
They can't produce

21:41.510 --> 21:42.880
immortality elixirs,

21:43.410 --> 21:44.040
but they can concoct

21:44.070 --> 21:45.480
temporarily effective poison pills.

21:46.720 --> 21:47.650
Perhaps Tian Rui

21:48.440 --> 21:50.030
bought one of their pills.

21:55.110 --> 21:55.960
Grab your things

21:56.560 --> 21:57.310
and come with me.

21:58.160 --> 21:58.680
Where are we going?

22:01.240 --> 22:01.960
To the mortuary

22:02.720 --> 22:03.350
for an autopsy.

22:17.810 --> 22:18.570
Xuanye!

22:23.230 --> 22:23.800
Hurry up.

22:28.140 --> 22:29.320
Doing this so late

22:29.490 --> 22:30.380
is such a sin.

22:38.750 --> 22:39.440
Well done.

22:41.920 --> 22:42.560
Did you encounter

22:42.590 --> 22:43.440
any trouble on the way?

22:44.790 --> 22:45.590
No trouble,

22:46.400 --> 22:47.240
but there was a surprise.

22:48.200 --> 22:48.920
What surprise?

22:49.480 --> 22:50.720
I met Manniang's sister-in-law.

22:54.830 --> 22:55.790
You met Banxia?

22:56.000 --> 22:56.400
Yes.

22:57.350 --> 22:58.310
How did you run into her?

22:58.910 --> 22:59.430
I don't know.

23:01.240 --> 23:01.960
What was she doing?

23:02.350 --> 23:02.880
Following me.

23:04.240 --> 23:05.170
Why would she follow you?

23:05.830 --> 23:06.400
To play with me.

23:07.830 --> 23:08.750
Play with you?

23:12.640 --> 23:13.400
What did you do?

23:13.790 --> 23:14.550
I played with her too.

23:15.720 --> 23:17.160
She followed me, trying to scare me,

23:17.550 --> 23:18.880
so I left her in the mortuary.

23:18.940 --> 23:19.690
I scared her back.

23:32.480 --> 23:32.960
Yan Li.

23:33.400 --> 23:34.030
Yan Li.

23:34.400 --> 23:35.350
Why did you fall asleep?

23:46.440 --> 23:47.000
Chief.

23:48.160 --> 23:48.880
If you want to sleep,

23:49.700 --> 23:50.980
do it at home after resigning.

23:51.590 --> 23:52.020
I wouldn't dare.

23:52.070 --> 23:52.500
I wouldn't dare.

23:53.510 --> 23:54.680
Next time I catch you...

23:54.970 --> 23:55.940
Chief, there won't be a next time.

23:56.070 --> 23:56.920
There won't be a next time, Chief Constable.

23:57.680 --> 23:58.550
I'm going to work now.

24:01.270 --> 24:01.720
Wait a moment.

24:04.110 --> 24:05.480
You're on duty at the mortuary today, right?

24:05.680 --> 24:06.240
Yes, Chief Constable.

24:06.920 --> 24:07.640
Open the door for me.

24:08.090 --> 24:08.650
Remember this.

24:09.430 --> 24:10.480
Before we come out,

24:10.750 --> 24:11.540
you stay here and guard.

24:11.720 --> 24:12.000
Yes.

24:12.110 --> 24:13.000
Don't let anyone in.

24:13.090 --> 24:13.640
Yes, Chief Constable.

24:19.350 --> 24:19.880
She followed me.

24:19.900 --> 24:20.580
She was trying to scare me,

24:21.160 --> 24:22.400
so I left her in the mortuary.

24:22.500 --> 24:23.260
I scared her back.

24:28.400 --> 24:28.750
Chief.

24:29.310 --> 24:30.340
If the lord asks tomorrow...

25:02.030 --> 25:02.680
Constable Li,

25:04.030 --> 25:05.510
have you ever seen in all these years

25:06.190 --> 25:07.620
a poison that can age someone overnight?

25:09.030 --> 25:09.480
No.

25:13.030 --> 25:14.510
If no poison is found in the stomach,

25:15.400 --> 25:16.240
what should we do?

25:18.110 --> 25:19.720
It could have been injected externally.

25:20.370 --> 25:22.080
Skin, blood, and hair

25:22.110 --> 25:22.640
all can be tested.

25:23.790 --> 25:24.480
However,

25:25.240 --> 25:26.440
she's been dead for a day.

25:26.720 --> 25:27.350
It might be difficult.

25:31.160 --> 25:32.200
Let's extract the stomach first.

26:39.000 --> 26:39.550
Who's there?

26:52.000 --> 26:52.540
Let's go back.

26:53.080 --> 26:53.580
Alright.

26:59.170 --> 26:59.720
Chief!

27:01.110 --> 27:01.830
The body is missing.

27:18.550 --> 27:19.110
Find it!

27:29.200 --> 27:29.790
It's alright now.

27:51.240 --> 27:52.400
Come, put this on.

28:02.880 --> 28:04.240
What were you doing at the government office?

28:07.440 --> 28:08.720
This case is extremely tricky.

28:09.000 --> 28:10.430
The culprit is likely to kill again.

28:10.720 --> 28:11.790
I must investigate first.

28:12.790 --> 28:13.590
As your father's matter,

28:13.830 --> 28:14.870
I've kept it in mind.

28:22.720 --> 28:23.110
We're here.

28:24.590 --> 28:25.350
Where are you going?

28:35.240 --> 28:36.070
About tonight,

28:36.790 --> 28:37.550
I'm sorry.

29:10.210 --> 29:10.790
Xuanye,

29:10.940 --> 29:11.730
do you want some radish?

29:19.960 --> 29:20.830
Rest up.

29:46.240 --> 29:47.000
Xuanye!

29:48.550 --> 29:49.550
Jiu Xuanye!

29:50.680 --> 29:51.720
Jiu Xuanye!

29:52.590 --> 29:53.550
Jiu Xuanye!

29:56.070 --> 29:56.750
Xuanye!

29:58.750 --> 29:59.440
Xuanye!

30:00.790 --> 30:01.720
Jiu Xuanye!

30:02.550 --> 30:04.080
I know you can hear me.

30:04.110 --> 30:05.240
I have something to tell you.

30:07.790 --> 30:08.680
Jiu Xuanye!

30:13.640 --> 30:14.240
Xuanye!

30:15.510 --> 30:16.480
Jiu Xuanye!

30:18.310 --> 30:19.080
Jiu Xuanye!

30:19.110 --> 30:19.920
Stop yelling.

30:34.440 --> 30:35.280
Why are you here?

30:36.030 --> 30:37.200
Didn't you call for me?

30:39.480 --> 30:40.790
I didn't call you to come over.

30:42.920 --> 30:43.510
Besides,

30:43.510 --> 30:45.030
couldn't you have given me a heads up before coming?

30:49.480 --> 30:50.630
What did you want to see me about?

30:57.590 --> 30:58.550
If you don't say it, I'm leaving.

31:01.780 --> 31:02.410
Wait.

31:16.500 --> 31:16.930
Yes,

31:18.600 --> 31:19.400
I'm not as capable as you.

31:20.880 --> 31:22.480
But compared to ordinary people,

31:23.170 --> 31:23.800
I should be considered as

31:23.830 --> 31:24.960
quite knowledgeable, right?

31:25.640 --> 31:27.460
Over the years, I've seen flying fish,

31:27.650 --> 31:28.830
talking spiders,

31:28.850 --> 31:29.850
children with tails,

31:30.030 --> 31:31.160
and butterflies that can pass through walls.

31:32.070 --> 31:33.480
Aren't they all strange

31:33.480 --> 31:34.240
and unique?

31:37.200 --> 31:38.110
I just want to ask you.

31:39.240 --> 31:40.470
Are mirrors that don't reflect people

31:40.490 --> 31:41.700
also very common?

31:44.280 --> 31:46.040
There was one at the fire scene in Nanyang City,

31:46.310 --> 31:47.640
one in my father's room,

31:48.110 --> 31:49.510
and also on at the restaurant in Guangping City.

31:49.880 --> 31:50.760
Why is it that whenever it appears,

31:50.790 --> 31:51.880
there's a murder?

31:56.030 --> 31:56.590
I know.

31:58.590 --> 31:59.440
You don't believe me.

32:01.640 --> 32:03.510
You think I'm just missing my father

32:05.200 --> 32:06.160
and making a fuss.

32:09.400 --> 32:10.160
But now,

32:10.160 --> 32:11.400
the evidence is right here.

32:13.410 --> 32:14.060
If you don't believe me,

32:14.080 --> 32:15.450
you should at least believe the evidence, right?

32:19.640 --> 32:20.790
You went to the government office just now

32:21.350 --> 32:22.440
to get this?

32:26.720 --> 32:27.960
The workers said

32:29.400 --> 32:30.880
it belonged to the dancer from last night.

32:36.030 --> 32:37.160
I will follow this lead

32:37.160 --> 32:38.030
and continue investigating.

32:38.590 --> 32:40.110
As soon as I have any news about your father,

32:40.640 --> 32:41.960
I'll let you know immediately.

32:43.750 --> 32:44.250
Wait.

32:45.030 --> 32:45.590
That's it?

32:46.640 --> 32:47.680
What else do you want?

32:51.590 --> 32:52.320
I want to be involved in

32:52.350 --> 32:53.240
the Yanlai Restaurant case.

32:53.960 --> 32:55.160
I want to find the killer with you.

32:56.510 --> 32:57.980
This matter involves demons.

32:58.210 --> 32:59.040
The dangers involved

32:59.070 --> 33:00.030
are beyond your imagination.

33:01.110 --> 33:01.960
If we find

33:01.960 --> 33:03.310
the murderer who killed the dancer,

33:03.510 --> 33:04.960
we can locate my father's whereabouts.

33:07.240 --> 33:08.240
So even if what lies ahead

33:08.240 --> 33:09.480
is a den of monstrous beasts,

33:11.030 --> 33:12.440
I will still risk my life to venture forth.

33:28.200 --> 33:28.830
Do you like it?

33:30.750 --> 33:31.480
Didn't I just

33:31.480 --> 33:32.350
eat one recently?

33:32.660 --> 33:34.920
[Chi Wangchuan]

33:32.920 --> 33:35.110
It won't hurt to have another one.

33:36.400 --> 33:37.030
You said before

33:37.590 --> 33:38.400
that one jade pear

33:38.480 --> 33:39.790
can maintain one's beauty for a year.

33:40.270 --> 33:41.550
I just had one recently.

33:41.880 --> 33:43.440
Why did you murder for a pear again?

33:43.920 --> 33:44.640
Especially...

33:45.550 --> 33:46.960
Especially murdering Tian Rui.

33:47.240 --> 33:48.070
She was jealous of you.

33:48.480 --> 33:49.350
She talked behind your back.

33:49.960 --> 33:51.200
Shouldn't I have killed her?

33:51.790 --> 33:52.350
But you...

33:52.350 --> 33:53.240
But what?

33:53.880 --> 33:54.880
You didn't even like her.

34:00.590 --> 34:01.240
Alright.

34:02.160 --> 34:03.160
I was wrong.

34:03.720 --> 34:04.510
I promise you.

34:05.590 --> 34:06.590
From now on, unless it's time...

34:07.030 --> 34:07.880
I won't kill anyone.

34:09.480 --> 34:10.330
You're just placating me again.

34:11.000 --> 34:12.190
You promised before too,

34:12.840 --> 34:13.440
but then you just

34:13.440 --> 34:14.400
went and did whatever you wanted.

34:15.510 --> 34:17.280
She's just Tian Rui.

34:18.070 --> 34:19.550
Is she worth getting so upset over?

34:23.510 --> 34:24.480
If you really don't eat it,

34:25.230 --> 34:26.070
it'll go to waste.

34:49.670 --> 34:50.320
Look.

34:51.920 --> 34:53.320
What a beautiful face.

34:54.510 --> 34:56.030
Who says beauty fades easily

34:56.590 --> 34:57.800
and youth is hard to keep?

34:59.070 --> 35:00.960
As long as I'm by your side,

35:01.590 --> 35:02.710
you won't age.

35:03.440 --> 35:04.670
You'll stay beautiful forever.

35:05.590 --> 35:07.280
Always heavenly beautiful,

35:08.590 --> 35:09.800
unparalleled in beauty.

35:12.980 --> 35:13.980
Recently,

35:14.320 --> 35:16.000
there's been quite a commotion.

35:16.230 --> 35:18.430
Your contract with the dance troupe is over.

35:19.170 --> 35:20.450
We should also change places

35:20.800 --> 35:22.000
and start a new life.

35:31.920 --> 35:32.590
Wen Jian!

35:33.670 --> 35:34.540
Xuanye is looking for you.

35:35.070 --> 35:35.630
What's wrong?

35:37.030 --> 35:37.590
He didn't say.

35:38.550 --> 35:39.150
How about

35:39.670 --> 35:40.920
I go back and ask, then come tell you?

35:41.180 --> 35:41.920
No, no, no.

35:41.960 --> 35:42.960
I'll go with you.

35:46.800 --> 35:47.960
Did you steal the body?

35:53.960 --> 35:55.550
Do you have any evidence?

35:56.230 --> 35:58.320
Did you steal the body?

35:58.960 --> 35:59.400
You...

35:59.840 --> 36:00.710
So, you don't have any evidence.

36:03.360 --> 36:04.760
If you don't have evidence, then what are you talking about?

36:05.440 --> 36:06.290
If you falsely accuse me again,

36:06.320 --> 36:07.110
be careful, I'll...

36:07.320 --> 36:08.590
report you to the lord.

36:09.510 --> 36:10.670
Is the body at Ganshan Clinic?

36:13.360 --> 36:15.190
Xuanye is just a charlatan.

36:15.800 --> 36:16.320
How can you be okay with

36:16.320 --> 36:17.400
leaving the body with him?

36:19.720 --> 36:21.280
Xuanye is capable.

36:22.010 --> 36:23.000
You should trust him.

36:23.380 --> 36:24.040
Why should I trust

36:24.070 --> 36:24.960
someone who could

36:25.710 --> 36:26.440
kill his own family?

36:26.760 --> 36:28.230
He didn't do that.

36:28.250 --> 36:30.000
Our government office has already reached a conclusion.

36:30.110 --> 36:30.900
Then who did it?

36:31.440 --> 36:31.960
A demon?

36:34.510 --> 36:35.880
The old case has been closed.

36:35.900 --> 36:36.700
There's no use in saying more.

36:36.880 --> 36:38.000
If you have more questions,

36:38.590 --> 36:39.320
go ask the lord.

36:39.920 --> 36:40.360
Chi Xue.

36:48.400 --> 36:49.550
Let me advise you one last time.

36:50.110 --> 36:51.320
Demons have a strong desire for revenge.

36:51.880 --> 36:53.510
Their methods are unpredictable and difficult to fathom.

36:54.190 --> 36:55.630
If you insist on getting involved,

36:56.230 --> 36:57.260
if anything goes wrong,

36:57.440 --> 36:58.440
I may not be able to look after you.

37:02.400 --> 37:03.670
It's not too late for you to back out now.

37:05.800 --> 37:06.800
Let's get started already.

37:07.030 --> 37:08.110
Stop dawdling.

37:13.360 --> 37:13.880
Xuanye.

37:14.880 --> 37:16.000
Someone at the government office insulted you.

37:16.800 --> 37:17.470
It doesn't matter.

37:17.710 --> 37:18.710
I didn't hear it anyway.

37:20.000 --> 37:20.840
Why is she here too?

37:22.070 --> 37:23.320
I asked her to stay here.

37:27.370 --> 37:28.970
I asked you to investigate recent cases.

37:29.030 --> 37:29.970
Do you have any results?

37:30.760 --> 37:31.400
There is actually one.

37:32.550 --> 37:34.130
The victim's death was very similar to Tian Rui's.

37:35.040 --> 37:35.570
Not long ago,

37:35.600 --> 37:36.760
the wife of Chief Secretary Zhang Cong

37:36.760 --> 37:37.480
disappeared without reason,

37:37.510 --> 37:38.840
but a mummified body appeared in their house.

37:39.550 --> 37:40.080
We investigated it

37:40.110 --> 37:41.030
as a disappearance,

37:41.030 --> 37:42.000
but we couldn't find any clues.

37:42.670 --> 37:43.360
Now that I think about it,

37:44.000 --> 37:44.610
that mummified body

37:44.630 --> 37:45.670
must have been Madam Zhang.

37:48.440 --> 37:49.000
Xuanye,

37:49.440 --> 37:50.000
didn't you say

37:50.020 --> 37:51.480
eating that jade pear

37:51.510 --> 37:53.070
could make one young again?

37:53.670 --> 37:55.070
How come people are dying from it?

37:55.710 --> 37:57.670
Because she took the child pear,

37:57.920 --> 37:58.510
not the mother pear.

38:06.920 --> 38:08.960
After the jade pear ripens,

38:09.150 --> 38:10.360
it splits into the child pear and mother pear.

38:11.000 --> 38:12.480
The Madam Zhang you just mentioned

38:12.630 --> 38:13.480
and the deceased Tian Rui

38:13.670 --> 38:14.550
probably both took

38:14.960 --> 38:15.960
the child pear.

38:16.760 --> 38:18.030
The effect of the child pear is short-lived.

38:18.440 --> 38:19.960
It can preserve the youth of the consumer for seven days.

38:20.480 --> 38:21.280
After seven days,

38:21.400 --> 38:22.800
it will drain all their life force,

38:23.030 --> 38:24.320
turning them into mummies.

38:25.400 --> 38:26.550
But the mother pear is different.

38:27.070 --> 38:28.760
After the person who took the child pear dies,

38:29.000 --> 38:29.780
sorcery can be used

38:29.960 --> 38:31.000
to remove their stomachs

38:31.190 --> 38:32.190
and obtain the mother pear.

38:32.840 --> 38:34.010
The mother pear will absorb

38:34.040 --> 38:35.000
the vitality of the deceased.

38:35.480 --> 38:36.440
If taken at this moment,

38:36.880 --> 38:38.150
not only can it restore youth,

38:38.560 --> 38:39.040
but it also

38:39.070 --> 38:40.030
has no harm to the body.

38:40.440 --> 38:41.480
So as long as one eats the mother pear,

38:41.510 --> 38:42.710
one can achieve immortality

38:42.730 --> 38:43.670
and eternal youth?

38:44.590 --> 38:45.840
There's no such thing as immortality.

38:46.440 --> 38:46.920
It just

38:46.920 --> 38:48.230
lasts for a year, that's all.

38:48.710 --> 38:49.400
After a year,

38:49.400 --> 38:50.670
if one doesn't take another mother pear,

38:51.000 --> 38:51.840
they will age

38:52.360 --> 38:53.480
back to their actual age.

38:54.190 --> 38:54.590
So,

38:55.110 --> 38:56.000
according to what you're saying,

38:56.030 --> 38:56.890
doesn't that demon

38:56.920 --> 38:58.150
have to come out and murder people often?

38:59.110 --> 38:59.590
Yes.

39:17.480 --> 39:18.320
Her stomach is missing.

39:18.750 --> 39:20.060
This... this...

39:20.480 --> 39:22.000
How is this possible?

39:22.340 --> 39:23.010
This... I...

39:36.320 --> 39:37.800
A tree root actually grew

39:37.830 --> 39:38.910
inside a human's abdomen.

39:39.590 --> 39:40.710
If I hadn't seen it with my own eyes,

39:40.730 --> 39:41.970
I wouldn't believe it even if you killed me.

39:43.030 --> 39:44.190
Humans have limbs and meridians.

39:44.320 --> 39:45.590
Trees have branches, leaves, and vines.

39:45.960 --> 39:46.920
Though they appear different,

39:47.190 --> 39:48.070
the principles are similar.

39:49.000 --> 39:50.840
Meridians become branches and the stomach condenses into a pear.

39:51.190 --> 39:51.960
It's just a demonic spell.

39:53.070 --> 39:53.840
I understand now.

39:54.230 --> 39:55.330
So it's a tree demon?

39:56.070 --> 39:56.920
Probably not.

39:57.630 --> 39:59.320
Any demon can practice demonic spells.

39:59.930 --> 40:01.160
Although this jade pear spell

40:01.190 --> 40:01.760
is uncommon,

40:02.030 --> 40:03.550
it's not exclusive to any particular type of demon.

40:04.440 --> 40:05.590
If I knew the method,

40:05.610 --> 40:06.500
I could master it too.

40:07.670 --> 40:09.070
To know what kind of demon it is,

40:09.440 --> 40:10.250
we need to know

40:10.280 --> 40:11.510
this demon's innate talent.

40:12.110 --> 40:13.030
Innate talent?

40:14.300 --> 40:14.780
Chi Xue.

40:20.230 --> 40:22.230
This mirror was left by Tian Rui

40:22.330 --> 40:23.370
backstage at Yanlai Restaurant

40:23.400 --> 40:24.440
before she died.

40:24.920 --> 40:26.400
There were also two mirrors where Ms. Duan's father

40:26.510 --> 40:27.540
had an accident.

40:28.920 --> 40:29.960
This is Tian Rui's mirror...

40:30.670 --> 40:31.590
This is evidence!

40:31.880 --> 40:32.720
How did it end up with you?

40:38.510 --> 40:39.110
It's nothing more than

40:39.110 --> 40:40.190
an ordinary mirror, isn't it?

40:41.000 --> 40:41.630
What's wrong with it?

40:43.590 --> 40:44.840
Its effect has already worn off.

40:45.360 --> 40:46.280
Last night,

40:46.440 --> 40:47.510
it couldn't reflect human images.

40:49.110 --> 40:50.320
If I'm not mistaken,

40:50.590 --> 40:51.920
after the demon used this mirror,

40:52.480 --> 40:54.320
it could only reflect objects,

40:54.550 --> 40:55.490
not people anymore.

40:56.400 --> 40:57.760
But after some time,

40:57.880 --> 40:58.800
it restored itself.

41:00.280 --> 41:01.880
The demon used this mirror?

41:02.510 --> 41:03.510
How did the demon use it?

41:04.800 --> 41:05.400
As a path.

41:06.320 --> 41:07.430
It used this mirror

41:07.460 --> 41:09.060
as a path for free movement.

41:10.760 --> 41:12.510
Using mirrors to come and go as it pleases

41:12.840 --> 41:13.560
is definitely not

41:13.590 --> 41:14.480
an ordinary method.

41:15.670 --> 41:16.280
This time,

41:16.790 --> 41:17.930
we might have encountered

41:17.960 --> 41:18.900
an enlightened Mirror Demon.

41:22.320 --> 41:23.070
A Mirror Demon? Then...

41:23.630 --> 41:24.280
How do we catch it?

41:25.110 --> 41:26.520
We'll catch it like how

41:26.550 --> 41:27.550
the victims summoned it.

41:29.840 --> 41:30.550
By peeling pears?

41:32.670 --> 41:33.350
Bronze mirror,

41:33.590 --> 41:34.250
red candle,

41:34.280 --> 41:35.670
pear, at 11:45 PM.

41:36.510 --> 41:37.640
We need to do the whole ritual

41:37.660 --> 41:38.700
without missing a single thing.

41:39.760 --> 41:41.550
And this place won't do.

41:42.230 --> 41:43.510
We need to find an empty house,

41:43.840 --> 41:45.550
preferably one that's been uninhabited for a long time,

41:45.670 --> 41:46.760
with a weak human presence.

41:49.030 --> 41:50.030
I can arrange that.

41:50.550 --> 41:51.280
What else do we need?

41:52.760 --> 41:53.760
We also need bait,

41:54.150 --> 41:55.000
preferably a woman.

41:55.550 --> 41:56.070
A woman?

42:13.880 --> 42:14.960
It's already time.

42:15.460 --> 42:16.530
Why hasn't the boss arrived yet?

42:17.110 --> 42:18.070
He should be here any moment.

42:19.440 --> 42:20.110
Ji Li.

42:22.360 --> 42:23.110
Come, sit down.

42:23.430 --> 42:23.800
Sit.

42:26.440 --> 42:27.440
Today, I specially

42:27.460 --> 42:28.860
brewed a pot of fine tea.

42:29.190 --> 42:30.320
It's top-quality tea.

42:30.590 --> 42:32.550
I'd like to share it with you.

42:32.760 --> 42:33.110
Come,

42:33.800 --> 42:35.110
let's chat while we enjoy it.

42:36.590 --> 42:37.000
Please.

42:46.190 --> 42:46.740
Ji Li,

42:48.400 --> 42:50.000
you've been working at Yunmen Dance Troupe

42:50.510 --> 42:51.510
for almost five years now, right?

42:52.670 --> 42:53.550
It will be five years in half a month.

42:53.920 --> 42:55.070
Today, I am

42:55.100 --> 42:56.910
putting my dignity on the line

42:57.280 --> 42:58.480
to ask you a favor.

42:59.550 --> 43:00.880
Please help me for another two years,

43:01.550 --> 43:02.070
alright?
